== NO-WRITE CONSTRUCTION ==
Every HTTP request issued this slice was GET except ONE spend-free POST: `/v1/health` (before x2, settle x3 + after x2),
`/` (index.html, before x1 + after x1), `/v1/taxonomy` (before + after), `/v1/analytics/summary?household_id=<seed>`
(before + after), `/v1/saved-searches?household_id=<seed>` (before + after), `/v1/assets/facets?household_id=<seed>`
(before + after), and the unauthenticated nginx gate (before + after). The one POST was
`POST /v1/chat/household?household_id=<seed>` on the OLD image, which returned the gate's 422 BEFORE reaching any
provider (zero spend). No post-change POST was issued. DB access was a read-only SQLite open (`file:...?mode=ro`) plus
`alembic current` (read-only). No credential file was fetched. The only mutating commands were the authorized
`docker compose build` + a single `docker compose up -d` recreate.

